    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618690/extras/8d71a134bd6717e2d7de7f1d2735b4eb.poster.avif?t=1749843430\" width=616 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618690/extras/8d71a134bd6717e2d7de7f1d2735b4eb.webm?t=1749843430\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618690/extras/8d71a134bd6717e2d7de7f1d2735b4eb.mp4?t=1749843430\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Wake Up Before It\u2019s Too Late</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trapped in a coma\u2019s grasp, your only hope is to navigate the endless depths of your subconscious. A mysterious elevator takes you on a journey through numerous floors, each leading to surreal realms of your own mind\u2019s creation. Seek the key to awakening to reunite with your family in the real world \u2014 or be lost to the dream forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618690/extras/b3cde5d93f456874df4591f74fb9be0e.poster.avif?t=1749843430\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618690/extras/b3cde5d93f456874df4591f74fb9be0e.webm?t=1749843430\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618690/extras/b3cde5d93f456874df4591f74fb9be0e.mp4?t=1749843430\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Conquer Deadly Trials</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outmanoeuvre deadly traps, manipulate complex Rube Goldberg machines, and engineer your own solutions to twisted, open-ended puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618690/extras/5877e983671cbb88f76e943332e16c5c.poster.avif?t=1749843430\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618690/extras/5877e983671cbb88f76e943332e16c5c.webm?t=1749843430\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618690/extras/5877e983671cbb88f76e943332e16c5c.mp4?t=1749843430\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Explore a Non-Linear Dreamscape</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a layered dreamworld where each floor offers a variety of intricate puzzles, hidden secrets, and new paths to uncover. Return to previous floors to reveal new challenges, and discover the most diabolical \u2014 yet rewarding \u2014 trials buried in the deepest parts of your psyche.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618690/extras/19cf4304c76f6aaf0ce3a1e83486ad48.poster.avif?t=1749843430\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618690/extras/19cf4304c76f6aaf0ce3a1e83486ad48.webm?t=1749843430\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618690/extras/19cf4304c76f6aaf0ce3a1e83486ad48.mp4?t=1749843430\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Create and Share Challenges</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own trials with the built-in level editor. Design cunning traps and devious puzzles, then share your creations with the community \u2014 or challenge yourself by playing levels made by others. </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618690/extras/8d71a134bd6717e2d7de7f1d2735b4eb.poster.avif?t=1749843430\" width=616 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618690/extras/8d71a134bd6717e2d7de7f1d2735b4eb.webm?t=1749843430\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618690/extras/8d71a134bd6717e2d7de7f1d2735b4eb.mp4?t=1749843430\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Wake Up Before It\u2019s Too Late</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trapped in a coma\u2019s grasp, your only hope is to navigate the endless depths of your subconscious. A mysterious elevator takes you on a journey through numerous floors, each leading to surreal realms of your own mind\u2019s creation. Seek the key to awakening to reunite with your family in the real world \u2014 or be lost to the dream forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618690/extras/b3cde5d93f456874df4591f74fb9be0e.poster.avif?t=1749843430\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618690/extras/b3cde5d93f456874df4591f74fb9be0e.webm?t=1749843430\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618690/extras/b3cde5d93f456874df4591f74fb9be0e.mp4?t=1749843430\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Conquer Deadly Trials</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outmanoeuvre deadly traps, manipulate complex Rube Goldberg machines, and engineer your own solutions to twisted, open-ended puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618690/extras/5877e983671cbb88f76e943332e16c5c.poster.avif?t=1749843430\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618690/extras/5877e983671cbb88f76e943332e16c5c.webm?t=1749843430\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618690/extras/5877e983671cbb88f76e943332e16c5c.mp4?t=1749843430\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Explore a Non-Linear Dreamscape</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a layered dreamworld where each floor offers a variety of intricate puzzles, hidden secrets, and new paths to uncover. Return to previous floors to reveal new challenges, and discover the most diabolical \u2014 yet rewarding \u2014 trials buried in the deepest parts of your psyche.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618690/extras/19cf4304c76f6aaf0ce3a1e83486ad48.poster.avif?t=1749843430\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618690/extras/19cf4304c76f6aaf0ce3a1e83486ad48.webm?t=1749843430\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618690/extras/19cf4304c76f6aaf0ce3a1e83486ad48.mp4?t=1749843430\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Create and Share Challenges</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own trials with the built-in level editor. Design cunning traps and devious puzzles, then share your creations with the community \u2014 or challenge yourself by playing levels made by others. </p>",
